  data: {
    LLM: "In a Standard game, focus on 'killing' the opponent's Aces and Tens. Use your trumps to seize the lead when you are void in a suit, then lead your own Ten to force them to play their King or Queen into your pile.\n\nThe Seven Management: If you bid 'Seven', you must keep the 7 of Trumps until the very last turn. This means you need enough other trumps to defend yourself throughout the round so you aren't forced to play the 7 early.\n\nDefensive Coordination: In the 2-vs-1 setup, the defenders must work together. If your partner is leading a suit, and you have the Ten, play it! You are giving points to the partnership rather than letting the declarer take them later.",
    Player: "In a Standard game, focus on 'killing' the opponent's Aces and Tens. Use your trumps to seize the lead when you are void in a suit, then lead your own Ten to force them to play their King or Queen into your pile.\n\nThe Seven Management: If you bid 'Seven', you must keep the 7 of Trumps until the very last turn. This means you need enough other trumps to defend yourself throughout the round so you aren't forced to play the 7 early.\n\nDefensive Coordination: In the 2-vs-1 setup, the defenders must work together. If your partner is leading a suit, and you have the Ten, play it! You are giving points to the partnership rather than letting the declarer take them later.",
